   <property name="toolTip">
    <string>Sets the Nav Pad mode.&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Modline&lt;/b&gt;: Use the Nav Pad with the modlines below like a regular SoftStep key.&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Program Change&lt;/b&gt;: For use with the Nav Yx10 &amp; Key” source — this allows the Nav pad to count &quot;decades&quot; from 0 to 12. This option will disable the use of modlines on the Nav Pad.</string>
   </property>
